  "notes": "Both images show the same pinout artwork (board underside, USB-C at top); each is transcribed separately per rule 11. Labels use the GPIO/power callouts; silkscreen spellings (GP28, EN, RUN...) first in functions, then callouts outward from the pin. GP1's serial callout is printed 'U0TXD' (same as GP0) and is recorded as printed. STRAP/SDIO/ROM boxes printed beside individual pins are kept as functions; PWM wave icons omitted."
